WEBVTT

00:00:03.320 --> 00:00:05.560
We were in danger the other day.

00:00:05.970 --> 00:00:08.770
A word appeared backwards in our handbook.

00:00:09.010 --> 00:00:12.840
It was a dangerous word that was trying to shorten Mitsuki's life.

00:00:13.060 --> 00:00:17.570
Thanks to Takuto, everything turned out fine, but what will happen the next time?

00:00:17.570 --> 00:00:19.870
We will have to keep an eye 
on Mitsuki from now on.

00:00:20.340 --> 00:00:21.070
Well, then...

00:00:21.070 --> 00:00:22.870
...I wonder what's going to happen today.

00:00:22.900 --> 00:00:23.450
Huh?

00:00:27.640 --> 00:00:28.820
Do you understand?

00:00:29.100 --> 00:00:29.670
Yes.

00:02:08.390 --> 00:02:11.100
Hey, how much longer do I have to be doing this?!

00:02:11.100 --> 00:02:12.720
Ah, please don't move.

00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:16.230
I have to hand in this homework 
assignment tomorrow.

00:02:16.690 --> 00:02:17.980
I get it!

00:02:24.990 --> 00:02:26.470
I need a break.

00:02:26.870 --> 00:02:27.910
Me too!

00:02:29.790 --> 00:02:31.490
Well, well? Show me!

00:02:32.790 --> 00:02:34.370
What!? {ROFL}

00:02:35.590 --> 00:02:37.250
What the hell is that?!

00:02:37.250 --> 00:02:38.030
It's you!

00:02:38.030 --> 00:02:39.700
How the hell does <i>that</i>  look like me?!

00:02:39.700 --> 00:02:40.520
Look!

00:02:40.520 --> 00:02:41.210
Huh?

00:02:41.210 --> 00:02:42.710
Cat ears.

00:02:43.050 --> 00:02:44.450
Come on...

00:02:44.450 --> 00:02:47.880
Hey, hey, Takuto, look at my picture, too!

00:02:49.600 --> 00:02:51.000
You know...!

00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:54.560
I drew twinkling stars in your eyes.

00:02:54.560 --> 00:02:57.000
Oh, maybe I should do that as well. {it's not a question lol}

00:02:57.120 --> 00:02:58.730
Hell No! {I think "Hell No!" flows better}{changed}

00:02:58.730 --> 00:03:00.720
How about some flowers in the background?

00:03:00.720 --> 00:03:03.000
Don't take something like that to school!

00:03:03.280 --> 00:03:04.190
Why not?

00:03:04.930 --> 00:03:06.150
It sucks.

00:03:06.150 --> 00:03:07.890
What do you mean it sucks?!

00:03:07.890 --> 00:03:09.620
I put all my heart into it!

00:03:09.820 --> 00:03:12.960
It doesn't matter how much heart you put into it... it still sucks. {Brutal honesty}

00:03:12.960 --> 00:03:17.100
I posed forever for you, and then you drew a crappy picture like that!

00:03:17.100 --> 00:03:19.290
I won't be a model for you anymore! {Geez Takuto, no need to be such a diva}

00:03:19.290 --> 00:03:20.090
Eh?

00:03:20.100 --> 00:03:21.250
But it's my homework...

00:03:21.250 --> 00:03:21.940
Like I care!

00:03:21.940 --> 00:03:23.800
Huh? Wait, Takuto!

00:03:23.800 --> 00:03:26.000
It's not <i>that</i>  bad... {lol, denial, well, you tried your best}

00:03:27.720 --> 00:03:29.880
But... maybe it really does suck...

00:03:50.160 --> 00:03:50.780
Huh?

00:03:52.920 --> 00:03:54.080
Oh my...

00:03:56.580 --> 00:03:57.950
What happened?

00:03:59.590 --> 00:04:02.920
I'm so hungry... I can't move...

00:04:02.920 --> 00:04:04.680
Hungry, you say?

00:04:07.260 --> 00:04:09.360
If he's lying here like that... {I'll call it a thought}

00:04:09.340 --> 00:04:11.340
...the neighbors will start spreading rumors!

00:04:11.640 --> 00:04:15.140
R-Really? Please come in.

00:04:15.140 --> 00:04:16.310
I'm sorry.

00:04:29.490 --> 00:04:31.280
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:04:32.450 --> 00:04:35.330
Huh? Where did he go?

00:04:35.640 --> 00:04:38.790
Huh? Huh? Huh?

00:04:41.080 --> 00:04:42.040
Oh no!

00:04:42.040 --> 00:04:45.040
It's bad enough that he was lying outside, but if he's lying in the house like this,

00:04:45.040 --> 00:04:47.560
what will the neighbors say?!!!

00:04:47.560 --> 00:04:50.130
A-Are you all right?

00:04:51.600 --> 00:04:53.900
Oh... oh! Sorry.

00:04:54.520 --> 00:04:58.100
I was checking the <i>feng shui </i> of the house when I got sleepy all of a sudden. {I don't feel the need to add the note for feng shui, or fuusui as the Japanese refer to it as}

00:05:03.470 --> 00:05:05.270
Let's dig in!

00:05:09.650 --> 00:05:10.470
Eh?

00:05:10.670 --> 00:05:12.230
<i>Feng shui</i> ?

00:05:20.830 --> 00:05:23.080
Did the shoes look like this?

00:05:25.130 --> 00:05:28.550
Wait for me, Takuto!

00:05:30.130 --> 00:05:31.850
Takuto! Your shoelace!

00:05:32.490 --> 00:05:33.010
Huh?

00:05:33.260 --> 00:05:34.970
Your shoelace is undone.

00:05:35.770 --> 00:05:39.430
Come to think of it, she didn't 
draw my shoes, did she?

00:05:40.770 --> 00:05:42.180
I'm obliged to you.

00:05:42.180 --> 00:05:44.760
Not at all. You're welcome.

00:05:45.890 --> 00:05:49.610
Oh. Please accept this in return.

00:05:50.280 --> 00:05:52.070
I wonder what it is? {A rock, maybe}

00:05:54.450 --> 00:05:55.000
Huh?

00:05:55.200 --> 00:05:56.760
Give me your hand.

00:05:56.760 --> 00:05:58.000
Y-Yes.

00:06:00.960 --> 00:06:02.700
What's this?

00:06:02.700 --> 00:06:04.660
The <i>Saint's Stone.</i>

00:06:05.010 --> 00:06:08.500
I thought he would give me something better...

00:06:08.500 --> 00:06:10.630
<i>Saint's Stone</i>... what's this supposed to be?

00:06:11.770 --> 00:06:12.710
Did you say something?

00:06:13.670 --> 00:06:15.580
N-Nothing at all.

00:06:16.990 --> 00:06:18.720
Then it's all good.{missing line}

00:06:19.250 --> 00:06:22.020
Well then, I'm obliged to you.

00:06:22.020 --> 00:06:24.430
Not at all. You're welcome.

00:06:28.070 --> 00:06:29.310
Phew.

00:06:29.310 --> 00:06:31.680
That thing sure was heavy.

00:06:45.000 --> 00:06:46.080
M-Madam.

00:06:47.000 --> 00:06:49.230
Welcome back, madam.

00:06:49.440 --> 00:06:51.320
I'm back.

00:06:52.800 --> 00:06:54.420
What's that?

00:06:55.840 --> 00:06:57.510
T-This is the <i>Saint's Stone.</i>

00:06:57.510 --> 00:06:58.840
An old man left it here...

00:06:58.840 --> 00:07:01.600
He said it brings good luck...

00:07:01.600 --> 00:07:02.760
Throw it out.

00:07:02.970 --> 00:07:03.370
Yes.

00:07:15.280 --> 00:07:17.940
I wonder if she managed to draw the shoes.

00:07:19.540 --> 00:07:21.330
Hey, Takuto.

00:07:21.330 --> 00:07:22.330
Huh? What is it?

00:07:22.330 --> 00:07:24.130
How was my drawing?

00:07:24.130 --> 00:07:25.000
It was okayish...

00:07:25.000 --> 00:07:27.160
Look. It's good isn't it?

00:07:28.080 --> 00:07:29.640
What should I say...

00:07:29.640 --> 00:07:33.170
I put all my love for you into it!

00:07:33.930 --> 00:07:35.130
Huh? All your love...

00:07:38.650 --> 00:07:41.740
I understand that you did.

00:07:41.740 --> 00:07:43.430
Really? You do?

00:07:43.930 --> 00:07:44.390
Yes! Love! Love! Love! {Alpha time later}

00:07:44.390 --> 00:07:44.970
Yes! Love! Love! Love! {Alpha time later}

00:07:44.970 --> 00:07:45.550
Yes! Love! Love! Love! {Alpha time later}

00:07:45.550 --> 00:07:46.510
Yes! Love! Love! Love! {Alpha time later}

00:07:46.510 --> 00:07:48.350
It was love that was moving my paintbrush! {Edited it to make it even more cheesier}

00:07:48.960 --> 00:07:49.460
Huh?

00:07:49.800 --> 00:07:51.020
Let's go back.

00:07:51.940 --> 00:07:53.370
Hey, wait!

00:07:53.370 --> 00:07:54.360
Geez.

00:08:02.250 --> 00:08:04.370
He didn't have to get so mad... {Yeah, he hid}

00:08:05.100 --> 00:08:08.690
Or say that it sucks...

00:08:09.160 --> 00:08:09.560
Huh?

00:08:19.930 --> 00:08:20.840
What was that?

00:08:23.880 --> 00:08:27.690
Since we finally get some time alone, let's go out on a date!

00:08:27.690 --> 00:08:29.200
Enough. Let's go home.

00:08:41.610 --> 00:08:43.240
W-What the...

00:08:43.240 --> 00:08:45.120
Takuto, what did you do?

00:08:45.120 --> 00:08:46.720
I didn't do anything!

00:08:46.720 --> 00:08:48.080
One more time!

00:08:48.080 --> 00:08:49.540
Here we go...

00:08:53.750 --> 00:08:54.880
Takuto!

00:08:55.650 --> 00:08:56.840
Takuto!

00:08:58.000 --> 00:08:59.370
It hurt!

00:08:59.400 --> 00:09:00.710
What happened?

00:09:00.710 --> 00:09:01.780
Dunno.

00:09:02.090 --> 00:09:03.340
But something's wrong.

00:09:10.480 --> 00:09:12.310
W-What's this?!

00:09:13.730 --> 00:09:14.850
Let's see... uh... uh...{Alpha time}

00:09:14.850 --> 00:09:16.480
Let's see... uh... uh...{Alpha time}

00:09:16.480 --> 00:09:18.230
Let's see... uh... uh...{Alpha time}

00:09:18.230 --> 00:09:20.460
Oh no, it's not in here.

00:09:21.070 --> 00:09:23.490
Then... in that case...

00:09:24.290 --> 00:09:26.620
In case of troubles not mentioned in the entries...

00:09:26.620 --> 00:09:27.200
Huh?

00:09:28.080 --> 00:09:30.910
"...contact your supervisor directly."

00:09:32.460 --> 00:09:33.420
Is it you, chief?

00:09:33.420 --> 00:09:35.880
It's Spring Onion Ramen.

00:09:35.880 --> 00:09:38.550
Yes. I have a question.

00:09:38.550 --> 00:09:39.920
We, the Shinigami...

00:09:39.920 --> 00:09:43.590
...we've been able to enter the house before, but suddenly, now we can't...

00:09:43.590 --> 00:09:45.410
Huh? There's a reason?

00:09:46.040 --> 00:09:47.990
What is it?

00:09:48.180 --> 00:09:48.940
Yes... yes... what?! {Alpha time}

00:09:48.940 --> 00:09:50.040
Yes... yes... what?! {Alpha time}

00:09:50.040 --> 00:09:50.970
Yes... yes... what?! {Alpha time}

00:09:50.970 --> 00:09:52.680
There's a barrier?!

00:09:52.770 --> 00:09:55.060
What?! A barrier?!

00:10:06.870 --> 00:10:09.840
Did he tell you the cause of this barrier?!

00:10:09.840 --> 00:10:10.450
Yes.

00:10:10.450 --> 00:10:11.700
The chief said that...

00:10:11.700 --> 00:10:13.200
...the barrier is caused by...

00:10:13.200 --> 00:10:15.750
...a stone called the <i>Saint's Stone.</i>

00:10:15.750 --> 00:10:17.210
<i>Saint's Stone?</i>

00:10:17.540 --> 00:10:18.790
You can recognize it from...

00:10:19.230 --> 00:10:23.170
...a sign on the back that says <i>Shinigami Expulsion.</i> {Don't remind me}

00:10:23.170 --> 00:10:26.250
And, what do we do with that stone?

00:10:26.250 --> 00:10:29.550
We have to break it or throw it in the water.

00:10:29.550 --> 00:10:30.600
All right...

00:10:30.600 --> 00:10:33.400
...so I say, but we still can't get past that barrier.

00:10:34.480 --> 00:10:35.950
Let's meet her.

00:10:36.280 --> 00:10:37.270
Okay.

00:10:37.270 --> 00:10:40.760
But who could have brought that stone?

00:10:40.970 --> 00:10:42.190
Maybe that grandmother?

00:10:42.190 --> 00:10:43.990
What if<i> she </i> did it?

00:10:45.530 --> 00:10:47.820
She wouldn't do something like that!

00:10:48.070 --> 00:10:50.580
I'm not so sure...

00:10:52.670 --> 00:10:56.160
If we aren't there for her, then she's the one who's in trouble!

00:10:56.170 --> 00:10:57.750
Well that's very true...

00:10:58.730 --> 00:11:00.070
Geez...

00:11:00.500 --> 00:11:02.460
Anyways, let's get in touch with her.

00:11:12.620 --> 00:11:14.190
Hello, this is Mitsuki.

00:11:14.560 --> 00:11:15.770
Ooshige-san?

00:11:19.480 --> 00:11:20.360
Who is it?

00:11:23.320 --> 00:11:25.820
Hello! Hello!

00:11:25.820 --> 00:11:27.410
It's me, Takuto!

00:11:27.410 --> 00:11:29.240
And Meroko! {she is so happy having her time with Takuto, Meroko is <3}

00:11:29.610 --> 00:11:31.240
Stop fooling around!

00:11:31.240 --> 00:11:32.780
I'm not fooling around!

00:11:37.000 --> 00:11:39.480
Stop harassing me! {XD}

00:11:40.080 --> 00:11:41.640
Stupid! Don't hang up!

00:11:42.820 --> 00:11:43.960
She hung up...

00:11:45.310 --> 00:11:47.640
But what did she mean by "harassing"?

00:11:48.350 --> 00:11:52.930
Could it be that the barrier doesn't let our voice in either?

00:11:53.600 --> 00:11:56.290
Since this didn't work, <i>that's</i>  next.

00:11:59.100 --> 00:12:03.450
"Come out of the house. - Takuto."

00:12:03.450 --> 00:12:04.830
Okay. This should work.

00:12:04.830 --> 00:12:08.950
It isn't okay at all!

00:12:09.150 --> 00:12:13.220
But... do you even know what you're writing on?!

00:12:13.220 --> 00:12:13.870
This?

00:12:13.870 --> 00:12:15.200
Yes!

00:12:17.910 --> 00:12:21.000
My picture!

00:12:22.580 --> 00:12:23.980
Okay, it's ready.

00:12:23.980 --> 00:12:24.980
All right...

00:12:29.380 --> 00:12:30.430
It worked!

00:12:36.350 --> 00:12:39.450
Man! Just when I'm cleaning up!

00:12:40.850 --> 00:12:42.270
There you go...

00:12:45.060 --> 00:12:46.530
It came back! {yeah, Mistuki is quick and she replied "I am not letting you in anymore! Chanto ayamare"}

00:12:46.530 --> 00:12:48.200
Huh? Why?

00:12:48.900 --> 00:12:50.390
What happened?

00:12:51.610 --> 00:12:52.080
Oh!

00:12:52.550 --> 00:12:53.620
What is it?

00:12:53.870 --> 00:12:55.020
The letters have disappeared.

00:12:55.160 --> 00:12:55.870
Really!

00:12:55.870 --> 00:12:56.410
Can it be...

00:12:59.120 --> 00:13:01.870
My drawing's gone too!

00:13:02.810 --> 00:13:04.380
Written stuff can't pass the barrier, either...

00:13:04.380 --> 00:13:08.050
My drawing of Takuto...

00:13:27.730 --> 00:13:29.030
Miso soup with tea.

00:13:29.030 --> 00:13:30.400
Pickles with sauce.

00:13:30.400 --> 00:13:31.970
What's wrong with her?

00:13:33.570 --> 00:13:36.000
Well, he's stubborn anyway.

00:13:46.130 --> 00:13:50.420
Takuto and Meroko didn't come back after all...

00:13:53.430 --> 00:13:56.090
Did I hurt his feelings that much?

00:13:58.350 --> 00:13:59.960
Stop it already.

00:13:59.960 --> 00:14:03.060
She'll go to school tomorrow anyway.

00:14:03.980 --> 00:14:05.730
Tomorrow will be too late!

00:14:05.730 --> 00:14:06.520
Why?

00:14:06.730 --> 00:14:08.020
She needs us today...

00:14:15.200 --> 00:14:15.660
Hello!

00:14:15.660 --> 00:14:18.700
Huh? Who is it?

00:14:19.030 --> 00:14:21.620
Don't you recognize my voice, honey? {lolwhut}

00:14:21.780 --> 00:14:24.240
Please, stop harassing me!

00:14:24.240 --> 00:14:26.790
Hey, don't hang up! {Shani: Ooshige <3}

00:14:26.790 --> 00:14:27.330
Huh?

00:14:27.630 --> 00:14:30.250
It's me, Ooshige!

00:14:30.840 --> 00:14:32.260
Ooshige-san!

00:14:32.630 --> 00:14:34.860
What did you mean?

00:14:34.860 --> 00:14:37.990
I'm the only one who knows your phone number.

00:14:37.990 --> 00:14:41.850
If you ask "Who is it?", maybe it's because you have a boyfriend...

00:14:41.850 --> 00:14:44.120
There's nobody else for me but Eichi-kun!

00:14:44.430 --> 00:14:45.960
You're right.

00:14:45.960 --> 00:14:47.400
Then what is it?

00:14:47.600 --> 00:14:50.150
Yesterday, somebody harassed me on the phone.

00:14:50.150 --> 00:14:51.880
Eh? Really?

00:14:51.880 --> 00:14:54.400
That worries me, should we change the number?

00:14:54.400 --> 00:14:57.110
No. It was only one phone call.

00:14:57.320 --> 00:14:59.390
Is it really all right?

00:14:59.390 --> 00:14:59.950
Yes.

00:15:00.370 --> 00:15:01.500
I see.

00:15:01.780 --> 00:15:04.200
Anyway, about the meeting at Ikebukuro today...

00:15:04.540 --> 00:15:06.330
...please be there 30 minutes early.

00:15:06.500 --> 00:15:07.540
Y-Yes.

00:15:07.960 --> 00:15:09.710
That's all I wanted to tell you.

00:15:09.710 --> 00:15:10.880
See you at the meeting.

00:15:11.170 --> 00:15:11.580
Yes.

00:15:15.340 --> 00:15:17.470
I'll have to leave at 12 if I don't want to be late.

00:15:21.970 --> 00:15:23.320
What should I do?

00:15:23.320 --> 00:15:26.630
Without Takuto and Meroko, 
I can't change and go out!

00:15:32.150 --> 00:15:33.980
It hurts...

00:15:33.980 --> 00:15:36.000
Just give up already.

00:15:36.000 --> 00:15:38.320
I won't give up when we already got this far!

00:15:38.570 --> 00:15:42.010
Damn! We could do something if only she would come out...

00:15:43.280 --> 00:15:44.240
Mitsuki?

00:15:46.830 --> 00:15:47.460
All right.

00:15:48.120 --> 00:15:51.500
Let's ask the housekeeper to send her out.

00:15:51.500 --> 00:15:53.420
Leave that to me!

00:15:59.200 --> 00:16:00.700
Are you perhaps...

00:16:01.350 --> 00:16:03.370
Are you perhaps...

00:16:08.330 --> 00:16:09.350
What is it?

00:16:11.200 --> 00:16:13.610
Who are you?!

00:16:13.900 --> 00:16:17.610
Would you happen to be from the household of Kouyama-sama?

00:16:18.530 --> 00:16:19.800
I am, but...

00:16:19.800 --> 00:16:21.450
That's great.

00:16:21.670 --> 00:16:22.660
Actually...

00:16:22.660 --> 00:16:27.410
I am greatly indebted to the young lady, Kouyama-sama...

00:16:27.410 --> 00:16:31.320
...and I'd like to express my gratitude to her.

00:16:31.620 --> 00:16:37.040
Would you please send her out?

00:16:37.040 --> 00:16:39.220
I-I'll go and ask madam!

00:16:40.210 --> 00:16:42.080
Please do...

00:16:44.060 --> 00:16:45.720
See? Everything went well.

00:16:46.140 --> 00:16:47.430
What went well?

00:16:47.430 --> 00:16:49.680
Didn't she just run away 
because you scared her?

00:16:49.680 --> 00:16:51.890
What's this fireball for anyway?!

00:16:51.890 --> 00:16:52.980
It's a prop.

00:16:53.860 --> 00:16:55.690
From the "Ghost Story of Peony Lantern"?

00:16:55.690 --> 00:16:56.940
Bingo!

00:16:56.940 --> 00:16:58.150
You got it!

00:16:59.530 --> 00:17:01.650
Huh? What are you doing?! {Faiabooru}

00:17:02.280 --> 00:17:03.940
Just as I thought... I can't leave it to you.

00:17:06.730 --> 00:17:08.580
I'll do something about this somehow. {Brain fart, oh, managed}

00:17:10.870 --> 00:17:12.040
What should I do?

00:17:12.700 --> 00:17:13.830
If I cancel...

00:17:13.830 --> 00:17:16.380
...it'll be a problem for Ooshige-san and the others who are waiting for me.

00:17:20.550 --> 00:17:22.510
Pizza from Wakaouji-sensei?

00:17:22.510 --> 00:17:23.720
I wonder why...

00:17:25.140 --> 00:17:25.930
Huh?

00:17:25.930 --> 00:17:27.250
What's this?

00:17:29.760 --> 00:17:30.710
<i>"Mitsuki:</i>

00:17:31.000 --> 00:17:33.640
<i>We can't enter the house 
because of the  </i>Saint's Stone.<i></i>

00:17:34.120 --> 00:17:37.370
<i>It's a stone that has  </i>Shinigami Expulsion <i>written on its back.</i>

00:17:45.780 --> 00:17:48.860
<i>If you don't know why, then come outside, and we'll think of something.</i>

00:17:49.290 --> 00:17:50.660
<i>Anyways, let's go."</i>

00:17:51.970 --> 00:17:55.140
So that's why they didn't come back, it was because of the barrier.

00:17:55.750 --> 00:17:58.670
Takuto... I'm sorry I doubted you.

00:18:02.800 --> 00:18:04.320
Okay, nobody's around!

00:18:07.410 --> 00:18:09.980
Mitsuki-chan! Where do you think you're going?

00:18:10.460 --> 00:18:12.410
J-Just for a walk.

00:18:12.410 --> 00:18:13.180
You cannot!

00:18:13.620 --> 00:18:16.190
But... I feel fine today...

00:18:16.640 --> 00:18:18.810
I even ate a pizza, so I'm full of energy!

00:18:19.020 --> 00:18:19.980
No way!

00:18:19.980 --> 00:18:23.990
There's a suspicious couple in weird costumes lurking out there. {Way to go, Meroko}

00:18:23.990 --> 00:18:26.160
They were asking about you.

00:18:26.160 --> 00:18:28.320
If something happens to you, 
it's my responsibility.

00:18:28.320 --> 00:18:31.250
So, please, stay in the house all day.

00:18:31.540 --> 00:18:33.000
B-But...

00:18:33.000 --> 00:18:36.790
I wonder who that "suspicious 
couple in weird costumes" are? {LOL}

00:18:36.790 --> 00:18:38.710
Who else but us?!

00:18:41.170 --> 00:18:42.680
What should I do?

00:18:42.680 --> 00:18:46.630
There's nothing else left but to call Ooshige-san and tell her I can't go.

00:18:56.570 --> 00:18:58.850
One of those stones must be the <i>Saint's Stone</i> !

00:19:02.320 --> 00:19:06.000
<i>Shinigami Expulsion</i>  is written on the back.

00:19:11.370 --> 00:19:12.950
Hurry! Hurry!

00:19:12.950 --> 00:19:14.330
We don't have much time!

00:19:15.860 --> 00:19:17.790
What are you doing, Mitsuki-chan?

00:19:17.790 --> 00:19:19.460
Um... n-nothing...

00:19:21.260 --> 00:19:23.080
You'll get scolded by madam!

00:19:23.610 --> 00:19:25.760
Anyways, the stone yesterday...

00:19:27.200 --> 00:19:29.960
You carried a big stone to 
the garden yesterday, right?

00:19:32.050 --> 00:19:34.180
"Old mansion...."

00:19:37.520 --> 00:19:39.310
What's with that stone?

00:19:39.310 --> 00:19:42.560
I'd like to drop it into the pond.

00:19:42.560 --> 00:19:43.510
Why for?

00:19:44.070 --> 00:19:46.650
"Why?" You mean I can't?

00:19:47.200 --> 00:19:50.620
Do whatever you want with it, 
but don't tell madam!

00:19:50.880 --> 00:19:52.020
Don't tell her?

00:19:52.610 --> 00:19:56.000
The stone I used for pickles 
broke, so I threw it out.

00:19:56.250 --> 00:19:59.320
Huh? That stone was for pickles?

00:19:59.530 --> 00:20:01.040
I see...

00:20:01.040 --> 00:20:03.960
I got a new stone yesterday.

00:20:04.590 --> 00:20:05.960
I see.

00:20:06.170 --> 00:20:08.500
Huh? A new stone?

00:20:13.600 --> 00:20:15.100
I've found it!

00:20:19.060 --> 00:20:21.310
One, two... there!

00:20:30.030 --> 00:20:34.580
"Old pond - the sound of a stone
 falling into the water."

00:20:42.440 --> 00:20:43.630
The barrier's gone!

00:20:43.630 --> 00:20:45.340
We don't have much time! Let's hurry!

00:20:46.730 --> 00:20:49.050
Takuto! Meroko!

00:21:05.860 --> 00:21:07.150
Hurry! Let's go!

00:21:07.480 --> 00:21:07.840
Okay.

00:21:09.490 --> 00:21:11.320
Good luck!

00:21:13.490 --> 00:21:14.280
We did it.

00:21:14.530 --> 00:21:15.880
I'm sorry for doubting you.

00:21:15.880 --> 00:21:17.790
Huh? What do you mean?

00:21:17.790 --> 00:21:21.040
Even though you were so nice to model for me.

00:21:21.300 --> 00:21:23.020
My pleasure!

00:21:29.670 --> 00:21:32.770
Why does it always have to be me..?

00:23:06.190 --> 00:23:09.650
This mini-concert is a great idea, but why in the mountains..?{shani: Mura ja nai, yama da!}

00:23:09.650 --> 00:23:13.900
It was her only wish to give a concert at the Hiiragi Preschool.

00:23:13.900 --> 00:23:14.610
Now I see!

00:23:14.610 --> 00:23:17.450
She even said that the girl over there looks just like she did when she was little.

00:23:17.450 --> 00:23:19.490
Yeah... I hope everything goes well.

00:23:19.490 --> 00:23:20.410
Wait, Takuto!

00:23:20.660 --> 00:23:24.330
That boy Taiki is trying to run off with Mitsuki's costume! {They said stone, but it's a pendant}

00:23:24.330 --> 00:23:25.370
What's going on?

00:23:25.370 --> 00:23:28.540
Weren't all the children looking forward to this concert?

00:23:28.540 --> 00:23:30.710
Next time on Full Moon wo Sagashite:

00:23:30.710 --> 00:23:32.300
A Tiny Concert
